    "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
    "text": "<p>Recent clinical evidence has found that when compared to manual surgery and instruments, Mako Robotic Arm Assisted Surgery with Stryker implants shows improved patient outcomes.</p>\n<p>Robert Cohen, Vice President, Chief Technology Officer, Research and Development, spoke with Yahoo! Finace to discuss the findings and what it means for the future of robotics in the medical space.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/robot-assisted-technology-helping-surgeons-163810715.html?soc_src=hl-viewer&amp;soc_trk=ma\">See the full interview</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n",
